@startuml
title 10. Generate content — already exists (cache hit)
autonumber
participant Client
participant Gateway
participant Content
database ContentDB

Client -> Gateway : POST /content/generate { poiId, mode } (Bearer)
Gateway -> Content : forward (validated)
Content -> ContentDB : find content by (poiId, mode)
ContentDB --> Content : found (text and/or audioUrl)
Content --> Client : 200 { status: COMPLETED, text?, audioUrl? }
note right of Client : show text and/or play audio immediately
@enduml
